+FastAPI will give each chunk of data to the `StreamingResponse` as is, it won't try to convert it to JSON or anything similar.
+
+The declared `response_class=StreamingResponse` is important: without it, a generator return value is not a raw binary response. You can instead return an already-created `StreamingResponse` object directly from an ordinary endpoint. If you need to stream JSON objects, use [JSON Lines](../tutorial/stream-json-lines.md){.internal-link} rather than sending undecorated objects as binary chunks.
 
